From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|maðr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*mann-}}, probably ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{m|ine-pro|*mánu-||person}}, {{m|ine-pro|*man-}}.

